Implemented US-012.

Changed [generate-types.ts](/Users/junwoobang/workflow/oa-sdk/packages/codegen/src/typegen/generate-types.ts) so external `$defs` and supported non-component schema aliases now reserve local schema names and generated operation type names before allocation. Operation-name collisions reuse the existing file-stem deterministic rename path and emit `external-schema-shadows-operation` diagnostics. Unsupported schema-position refs into non-schema OAS roots now emit `external-schema-unsupported-pointer` and fall back to `unknown` so generated TypeScript does not contain dangling aliases.

